# CRSP raw pulls are LICENSED data (CRSP / WRDS subscription). They must NEVER be
# committed or shipped to the browser — redistribution violates the WRDS license.
#
# Only three things from the CRSP pipeline are allowed into the repo:
#   1. this folder's README.md and .gitignore          (docs, no data)
#   2. *.manifest.json  — pull provenance (dates, row counts, filters), no rows
#   3. the reduced AGGREGATE outputs in src/data/generated/crsp-*.ts
#
# Everything else here (the raw CSV/Parquet pulled from WRDS) stays local.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.manifest.json
